{"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "title": "弱传播", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1707460145, "updated": [{"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "bookmarkId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK_4_10407-10535", "createTime": 1707460145, "range": "10407-10535", "markText": "压强的公式P=F/S，S 就是面积。舆论的压强是压在表面上的，跟体积无关，而是跟表面积有关。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "Ⅰ 什么是舆论", "chapterUid": 4, "chapterIdx": 4}], "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "version": 1861216242, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "coverBoxInfo": {"colorsPure": ["#93B0DA", "#98B8DD"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7ORnqSWcK", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "这章纯属扯淡，试图用偶然的自然现象证明人类信息传播的某种说法，风马牛不相及。", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "3001", "abstract": "自然科学的光芒一直照耀着笔者对舆论世界的探索之旅，在本书随处可见这种“光合作用”，诸如数学的集合理论，化学的高分子链理论，生物学、医学的病毒传播理论，被我直接拿来转化为舆论学的解释工具。舆论学从自然科学可以得到的启示，绝不低于其他社会科学。\n[1]2016年6月27日晚，台湾新北市八仙乐园举办“彩虹趴”意外起火，导致助燃性粉尘爆炸。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7ORnqSWcK", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707493350, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "Ⅴ 自然的启示", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7ORlZOOYD", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "先不管是否有道理，这描述本身就前后矛盾啊。", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "1954-2082", "abstract": "第八，轻规则：舆论世界是避重就轻的传播世界。在舆论世界里，轻重判断与现实世界基本倒置。现实世界中重要的东西，在舆论世界未必重要；现实世界不重要的东西，在舆论世界可能很重要。其通俗的表达是：轻的东西最好传播。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7ORlZOOYD", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707492034, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "Ⅳ 弱传播理论", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OQQQcZtv", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "绝对不仅仅是一个世界。", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "457-483", "abstract": "舆论不仅是人类的一个行为，而且是人类创造的一个世界。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "17408780_7OQQQcZtv", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707463492, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "Ⅲ 舆论是怎样的世界", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OQQw7Ich", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "在AI的年代，就不适用了，用来训练的语料信息，没人关注也有价值。", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "4467-4502", "abstract": "信息只有被传播，才有价值；传播只有被关注，才能实现价值。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7OQQw7Ich", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707463195, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "Ⅱ 我们生活在两个世界", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OQOFBaPz", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "可见“可信信息源”的重要性，而如今社会已经基本丧失了。", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "3206-3380", "abstract": "虽然所有的二手货都是值得怀疑的，可是没有一个人可以做到彻底的怀疑。不仅没有钱，也没有能力，更没有时间。如果一个人对所有传播来的信息表示怀疑，都要亲力亲为去一一验证：唐朝有李白这个人吗？我要穿越去看一看。动物园真的老虎咬死人了吗？我要去找证人。新闻稿里的美国总统说的话是真实的吗？我要调查一下。印尼真的地震了吗？我要去实地考察一下……这个人就是疯子。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7OQOFBaPz", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707461503, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "Ⅱ 我们生活在两个世界", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OQOmjJvk", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "两个世界是“意象”的一种说法而已，客观世界与人的主客体关系一直是各个哲学家思考的重点问题，李普曼并不能因为这个概念而“傲视”他的前辈们。在这个点上，哲学分支的现象学要走得更远更深。", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "1894-1994", "abstract": "李普曼“两个环境说”就是“两个世界理论”的前身。我认为，李普曼之所以可以傲视之前包括黑格尔、卢梭在内的所有舆论研究者，被称为舆论学之父，就是他提出了一个“虚拟环境理论”，这是“舆论世界论”的理论雏形。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7OQOmjJvk", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707461218, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "Ⅱ 我们生活在两个世界", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OQNYG4Nw", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "反物质与物质接触后会出现湮灭效果，作者能不能停止乱套概念，读起来太难受了。", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "991-1016", "abstract": "正如物质有反物质一样，舆论世界是现实世界的反世界。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7OQNYG4Nw", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707460869, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "Ⅱ 我们生活在两个世界", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OQNmuS9b", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "我怎么感觉作者在瞎比喻，偷换概念？", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "11169-11227", "abstract": "群体动力学必须与流体力学及表面力学结合起来，紧紧扣住舆论的表面性，探讨舆论的表面涌动与表面运动，才能抓住舆论的真谛。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 4, "reviewId": "17408780_7OQNmuS9b", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707460304, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 4, "chapterTitle": "Ⅰ 什么是舆论", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OQN5dRrv", "review": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "content": "客体的一致性在当今的舆论环境绝难保证，公众貌似在讨论一件事，却绝非一件事。", "bookVersion": 1861216242, "range": "9721-9757", "abstract": "根源就在于舆论的客体（对象）是一致性的，而舆论的本体（关注）是不一致的。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 4, "reviewId": "17408780_7OQN5dRrv", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707460049, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_6YQCDOCBwA626la6keFqQ1uK", "format": "epub", "version": 1861216242, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_1bSEr8Eso8zG6is6gp2Ut6xa_parsecover", "title": "弱传播", "author": "邹振东", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 4, "chapterTitle": "Ⅰ 什么是舆论", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking"